        <li><span>03</span><p><strong>What equipment you have</strong><small>Include the camera model if you already purchased it.</small></p></li>
        <li><span>04</span><p><strong>A photo if it helps</strong><small>A wide view of the mounting area can answer several questions.</small></p></li>
